~ day_start
Kid: Mum...are we there yet?
Mum: What?! We've only just started!
Kid: Long car rides are so [shake]borrring[/shake].
Mum: This is going to be a long [color=red]3 Day road trip[/color], and it looks like this weather's going to be with us for a while. Hmm.
Kid: Ooh, I could pass the time by [color=gold]racing raindrops[/color]!
Mum: That sounds fun!


do game.begin_game()

=> END


~ day_end
Mum: The sun is out on Day 1!
Kid: Are we there yet?
Mum: Not even close.

do game.end_day()

=> END